# [DD-13b.W1.1 r46sem finding 19] `name 9bad` -- a name that CANNOT be a
# PCRE2 group name or a C identifier. Legs A and B already refuse it (A:
# "'name' wants an identifier"; B's `[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*` arm does not
# match at all, falling to its own catch-all); leg C used to accept it
# with no identifier check.
pattern a+
name 9bad
m "aaa" 0 3
